      "text_length": 3501,
      "checked_at": "2026-10-15T02:53:57+00:00",
      "text": "The Institute of Management Accountants and Financial Professionals | IMA Welcome to the Institute of Management Accountants Sign In Join IMA Membership Training Career Certifications Community Publications We set the standard for accounting and finance professionals worldwide Trusted content, credentials, and community that drive better business decisions and outcomes. Join IMA Explore courses A century of leadership and professional development The Institute of Management Accountants is a global association at the intersection of accounting, finance, and business strategy. We provide knowledge and connections that help teams and individuals feel impactful, confident, and successful. 120k+ members worldwide Be part of a global organization 200+ active local chapters Connect with your community 100+ years of experience Learn our history The world’s top organizations build financial competency with IMA Our courses teach accounting and finance professionals how to become strategic business partners. Learn more about corporate memberships Earn credentials that open doors Show what you’re capable of Earning a credential from IMA signals more than technical skill. It shows your employer you think strategically, make sound decisions, and understand the bigger business picture. Whether you’re early in your career or ready for your next move, IMA has credentials built for every stage. The CMA (Certified Management Accountant) is the globally recognized standard in management accounting — and a proven path to bigger roles and better opportunities. Get your certification Learn what actually matters for your career Our research-backed Competency Framework defines the 10 core skill areas that modern accounting and finance professionals need to stay ahead. Assess your gaps, then choose the training and learning pathways that fit your role and goals. Learn more about our training Make valuable connections with other professionals Experience hands-on learning at IMA’s global conferences, workshops, and live webinars. Join our local chapters to network in person and develop deep connections with other management accountants. Explore our networking events Our thought leadership shapes the industry Explore our publications Digital publications Read the latest trends in our award-winning Strategic Finance Magazine and more. Read articles Research We fund thought-provoking research through grants to academics and doctoral students. Learn about our research Podcast The Count Me In podcast features talks with industry experts and thought leaders. Listen now Joining the IMA community is an investment in your future Become a member and build relationships, enrich your career, and prepare yourself for the future. Start your membership today Build your community “IMA has been my professional family, and it’s really helped me develop into the leader that I am.” Virginia D. White, CMA, CSCA Corporate Purchasing Finance Director, Cummins Want to learn more about IMA? Our valuable courses and certifications help you stay ahead with the latest trends, research, and best practices in management accounting. Email us at [email protected] Call us at (800) 638-4427 Company About IMA IMA Leadership Our Certifications Press Releases Ethics Center Careers at IMA Support Donate Knowledge Center Chapter Leader Portal Volunteering with IMA Sponsorships Contact Us Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Cookie Policy © 1997-2026 Institute of Management Accountants. All Rights Reserved.",
