      "checked_at": "2026-10-15T02:53:57+00:00",
      "text": "ICAI - The Institute of Chartered Accountants of India 0 Welcome to ICAI-ASB's New Website! Discover a fresh look and enhanced features ACCOUNTING STANDARDS BOARD Home About Us About ASB Functions/Objectives/Terms of Reference Board Composition Annual Reports Certificate Course About Certificate Course on Ind AS List of Qualified Members Knowledge Dissemination Activities Refresher Courses Details of Past Seminar & Events Other E-Learning Initiatives Educational Videos Publications Accounting Standards(AS) Indian Accounting Standards (Ind AS) Other Publications Checklists & Formats CHECKLISTS FORMATS Knowledge Gateway ASB Meetings updates Effective date of Ind AS Amendments Accounting Standards Setters outside India IFRS Convergence Status of Indian Accounting Standards Torch Bearers of Accounting Standards Boards of ICAI Ciruclars/Notification/Press releases issued by regulatory Bodies Contact Us Search... Search ICAI Links Central Council Library Covid 19 Resource Election - 2021 e-Journal EOI/Tenders ICAI Wall - Apps & Portals Institute's Program Know Your Ethics Placements Notifications CA. Prasanna Kumar D President, ICAI CA. Mangesh Kinare Vice-President, ICAI CA.(Dr.) Sanjeev Kumar Singhal Chairman, Accounting Standards Board CA. Vishal Doshi Vice-Chairman, Accounting Standards Board Forthcoming Events Launch of 'Certificate Course on Indian Accounting Standards (Ind AS)' - Online Batch 87 - Starting from 24th October 2026. View All About the Board The Accounting Standards Board (ASB) was constituted by the ICAI in 1977 with a view to formulate Accounting Standards to provide a sound, reliable and high-quality accounting, and financial reporting system and to harmonise the diverse accounting policies and practices in India. The ASB, since its inception, has been constantly working in this direction by formulating new Accounting Standards as well as revising the existing Accounting Standards from time to time with the objective to bring the Standards in line with the International Financial Reporting Standards (IFRS), as issued by the International Accounting Standards Board (IASB). The ASB with a view to provide guidance on the uniform applications of the Accounting Standards in an increasingly complex business environment, also issues various guidance materials from time to time. Read More What’s new. Announcement of Online Examination of the 'Certificate Course on Indian Accounting Standards (Ind AS)’ to be held on 13th December 2026. Declaration of result of the online examination (A25) of the 'Certificate Course on Indian Accounting Standards (Ind AS)' held on 13th September, 2026 Participate in the Online Weekly Accounting Quiz (October 9, 2026 to October 15, 2026) launched by the Accounting Standards Board. Request for Information on Post-implementation Review of IFRS 9-Hedge Accounting issued by the IASB Tentative Agenda Decision on Assets that Generate a Return Individually and Largely Independently of an Entity's Other Resources (IFRS 18) Tentative Agenda Decision on Estimating Residual Value (IAS 16) Tentative Agenda Decision on Sale of Equity Investments Measured at Fair Value through Other Comprehensive Income (IFRS 9) Self-Paced Course on Accounting Standards (AS), Ind AS & Ind AS 117. Launch of Self Paced Course on Ind AS & AS 'FAQs on key accounting implications arising from the New Labour Codes' \"Announcement providing relaxation in compliance with the 'Guidance Note on Financial Statements of Non-Corporate entities' and 'Guidance Note on Fina Submit Accounting Issues on Guidance Note on Financial Statements of Non-Corporate Entities to the Expert Panel. Tentative Agenda Decision on Embedded Prepayment Option (IFRS 9). Tentative Agenda Decision on Determining and Accounting for Transaction Costs (IFRS 9). Tentative Agenda Decision on Updates to Committee’s agenda decisions for IFRS 18. FAQs on Guidance Note on Financial Statements of Non-corporate Entities. - (08-07-2025) Request for Information on Post-implementation Review of IFRS 16 Leases by IASB Exposure Draft of Ind AS 118, Presentation and Disclosure in Financial Statements Announcement regarding Revised Criteria for classification of Non-company entities for applicability of Accounting Standards Tentative Agenda Decision on Recognition of Revenue from Tuition Fees (IFRS 15) Tentative Agenda Decision on Guarantees Issued on Obligations of Other Entities Exposure Draft on Equity Method of Accounting - IAS 28, Investments in Associates and Joint Ventures (revised 202x) Exposure Draft of Amendments to the Classification and Measurement of Financial Instruments: Amendments to Ind AS 109 and Ind AS 107 Exposure Draft of Annual Improvements to Ind AS (2024) - Corresponding to Annual Improvements to IFRS Standards Volume 11 issued by the IASB Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) Second Amendment Rules, 2024 Exposure Draft on Translation to a Hyperinflationary Presentation Currency - Proposed amendments to IAS 21 Exposure Draft on Climate-related and Other Uncertainties in the Financial Statements - Proposed illustrative examples Amendments to AS 22, Accounting for Taxes on Income issued by the ICAI (For non-company entities) Exposure Draft of the International Non-Profit Accounting Guidance (INPAG) - Part 3 Educational Material on Ind AS 12, Income Taxes Research Projects Launch of ICAI ASB - Quiz Compendium of Indian Accounting Standards (Year 2023-2024) Role of Accounting Standards and Financial Statements (Hindi) View More Documents Open For Comments Accounting Quiz Photo Gallery ICAI Services For Ordering Publications Digital Learning Hub ASB-ICAI TV(Webcast channel) E- Sahaayataa Portal Accounting Standards Board(ASB) The Institute of Chartered Accountants of India (set up by an Act of Parliament) Visitors Count [dynamic] QUICK LINKS ICAI-ASB Quiz IASB IFAC SAFA XBRL India Ministry of Coroporate Affairs Securities and Exchange Board of India Archive Section Site Map Terms & Conditions GET IN